# Reviewed container findings that container-scan.yml should not fail on.
# One ID per line. Put the reason and an expiry date on the line above it, and
# remove the entry once the base image carries the fix. `exp:` makes Trivy stop
# honoring the entry on that date, so a forgotten exception fails the scan again:
#
# # Not reachable: the image runs no <component>.
# CVE-2026-00000 exp:2026-12-01
